            jonas("Ich bin Softwareentwickler von Beruf. [repeat]", "I am a software developer by profession."),
            leo("Is that the whole introduction?"),
            maya("Almost. The exam card has six words: «Name», «Alter», «Land», «Wohnort», «Sprachen» and «Beruf». Say one sentence for each. Age and languages go like this."),
            jonas("Ich bin achtundzwanzig Jahre alt. Ich spreche Englisch und Hindi. [repeat]", "I am twenty-eight years old. I speak English and Hindi."),
            leo("So what should I remember for the Goethe exam?"),
            maya("Three things. The speaking part starts with exactly this: name, country, town and job, one sentence each. In the listening part, «Woher kommen Sie» asks where you're from, not where you live. And if you miss something, «Wie bitte» rescues the turn."),
            leo("And something to try today?"),
            maya("Record the introduction on your phone and listen to it once. Say your name, country, town and job. Spell your surname with the German letter names. Use «Wie bitte» once, deliberately. And listen for your own w and v, and fix one."),
