    private val de2Words = Podcast(
        "de2-words",
        listOf(
            maya("Hi, and welcome back. Today is family, numbers and countries: who is in your family, how old they are, and where they come from. The Goethe exam loves all three, so Jonas has a lot for you to say out loud."),
            jonas("Meine Familie wohnt in Karachi. [repeat]", "My family lives in Karachi."),
            leo("Straight in with «meine». Is that just my?"),
            maya("It is my, and it changes with the word after it. Family is a die word, «die Familie», so my becomes «meine». Learn every family word with its der, die or das, the way you learn a phone number with its area code. Let's start with the couple: a man and a woman."),
            jonas("Der Mann. Die Frau. [repeat]", "The man. The woman."),
            leo("Man and woman. Simple enough."),
