            leo("Why «mein Mann» but «meine Frau»?"),
            maya("Same rule as «meine Familie». «Mann» is a der word, so plain «mein». «Frau» is a die word, so «meine», with an extra e. Now the parents."),
            jonas("Meine Mutter kocht gern. Mein Vater ist Ingenieur. [repeat]", "My mother likes cooking. My father is an engineer."),
