            jonas("Wie alt bist du? Ich bin achtundzwanzig Jahre alt. [repeat]", "How old are you? I'm twenty-eight years old."),
            leo("And my phone number? Do I say it in big chunks?"),
            maya("Digit by digit is the safest. Say you're at the language school office: the secretary is formal with you, so she asks with «Ihre», your, for «Sie»."),
            jonas("Wie ist Ihre Telefonnummer? Null, eins, sieben, drei. [repeat]", "What is your phone number? Zero, one, seven, three."),
