            maya("«Kommen aus» for the country, «sprechen» for the language. Usaid comes from India, Sanya from Pakistan, and they live in Qatar, which German spells «Katar», with a K."),
            jonas("Usaid kommt aus Indien. Ich spreche Englisch und ein bisschen Deutsch. [repeat]", "Usaid comes from India. I speak English and a little German."),
            leo("And on forms? I keep seeing very long words."),
            maya("Two form words are worth knowing. «Staatsangehörigkeit» is nationality. And for marital status you tick «ledig», single, or «verheiratet», married."),
            jonas("Ich bin ledig. Ich bin verheiratet. [repeat]", "I'm single. I'm married."),
            leo("So what should I remember for the Goethe exam?"),
