            jonas("Hast du Kinder? Sie hat zwei Schwestern. [repeat]", "Do you have children? She has two sisters."),
            leo("Okay, and the bottom of the ladder?"),
            maya("We, you all, and they. Most of them are just «haben», like the dictionary form. The odd one is «ihr», you all, for a group of friends. It takes «habt»."),
            jonas("Wir haben Zeit. Habt ihr Hunger? [repeat]", "We have time. Are you all hungry?"),
            leo("And they? Is that another new word?"),
