            jonas("Du hast Kinder. Hast du Kinder? [repeat]", "You have children. Do you have children?"),
            leo("And questions with a question word? Like how old?"),
            maya("That's a «W-Frage», a question that starts with a w word, like «wie», «wo» or «woher». The w word takes the first place, and the verb stays second."),
