            leo("Okay. Now questions. How do I ask when?"),
            maya("Questions that want information start with a W-word. «Wann» is when, «wo» is where, «was» is what, «wer» is who, «wie» is how. And the shape is fixed. Picture three seats in a row: the W-word sits in seat one, the verb always sits in seat two, then the person."),
            jonas("Wann kommst du nach Hause? [repeat]", "When are you coming home?"),
            leo("Can I say «Wann du kommst», like English when you come?"),
