            leo("[sigh] «Wo», «woher», «wohin». Three words for where?"),
            maya("Think of arrows. «Wo» is just where something is, no arrow. «Woher» is where from, the arrow coming towards you. «Wohin» is where to, the arrow pointing away. To ask which country someone is from, it's «woher»."),
            jonas("Woher kommst du? Wohin gehst du? [repeat]", "Where are you from? Where are you going?"),
