            maya("«Wie viel» is how much, for the shop. «Warum» is why. For example, a curious colleague asks about your German class."),
            jonas("Wie viel kostet das? Warum lernst du Deutsch? [repeat]", "How much does that cost? Why are you learning German?"),
            leo("Last thing: time words. «Am», «um», «im». Which is which?"),
