            leo("So what should I remember for the Goethe exam?"),
            maya("Three things. In the writing part, endings get marked: «du arbeitest», «wir lernen». In the listening and speaking parts, the W-word tells you what's wanted: «woher» wants a country, «wann» wants a time. And keep the verb second, even after «am Montag»."),
            leo("And something to do today?"),
            maya("Ten minutes, out loud. Conjugate «arbeiten», «lernen» and «machen», all six persons. Then ask four W-questions about your day, and answer each in a full sentence. For the last one, put a time phrase first and keep the verb second."),
