            maya("«der Zug». The bus is «der Bus» too. In the city you also have «die U-Bahn», the underground, and «die Straßenbahn», the tram. Learn each one with its article, like a name tag on the word. Picture Usaid going to the language school in the morning."),
            jonas("Ich nehme die U-Bahn. [repeat]", "I take the underground."),
            leo("And if I go by car, or by bike?"),
