            jonas("Ich fahre mit dem Fahrrad. Wir fahren mit dem Taxi. [repeat]", "I go by bike. We go by taxi."),
            leo("What about flying? Sanya's family is in Doha. Do I still say «fahren»?"),
            maya("No, and that's a classic mistake. You «fahren» in anything on the ground: train, bus, car. In a plane you «fliegen». The plane is «das Flugzeug», and the airport is «der Flughafen»."),
