            leo("[chuckle] Okay. Now I'm at the station, and I need a ticket."),
            maya("You go to «der Schalter», the ticket counter. A ticket is «die Fahrkarte», or just «das Ticket». And the first question you'll hear there is a little trap."),
            jonas("Einfach oder hin und zurück?", "Single or return?"),
            leo("«Einfach»? Doesn't that mean easy?"),
