            jonas("Eine Fahrkarte nach München, bitte. Einmal hin und zurück. [repeat]", "A ticket to Munich, please. One return."),
            leo("Great. And then where's my train?"),
            maya("Look at «der Fahrplan», the timetable, and the big board. Two words sit side by side: «die Abfahrt», departure, and «die Ankunft», arrival. The front piece is the whole word: «ab» is away, «an» is at. Your train stands at «das Gleis», the track number, and you wait on «der Bahnsteig», the platform."),
            jonas("Der Zug fährt von Gleis drei. [repeat]", "The train leaves from platform three."),
