            jonas("Nimm die Tabletten! [repeat]", "Take the tablets!"),
            leo("And «schlafen»? «du schläfst», so «schläf»?"),
            maya("Good guess, and it's the classic mistake. The umlaut, the two dots, drops in the command. «du schläfst» gives «schlaf». Same with «fahren»: «fahr»."),
            jonas("Schlaf gut! [repeat]", "Sleep well!"),
            leo("[laugh] Sleep well, as an order. And for a group of friends?"),
            maya("That's the «ihr» form, without «ihr». «ihr nehmt» becomes «nehmt», «ihr schlaft» becomes «schlaft». Picture saying good night to a room full of children."),
            jonas("Schlaft gut, Kinder! [repeat]", "Sleep well, children!"),
            leo("And «sein»? That one's always strange."),
            maya("It is. «Seien Sie», «sei» and «seid». And «haben» gives «Haben Sie Geduld», be patient. «die Geduld» is patience, which every waiting room needs."),
            jonas("Sei ruhig! Haben Sie Geduld! [repeat]", "Be quiet! Be patient!"),
            leo("What about verbs with a little piece in front, like «anrufen»?"),
