    private val de12Words = Podcast(
        "de12-words",
        listOf(
            maya("Welcome to the last word episode. The official Goethe A1 word list, the «Wortliste», has about six hundred and fifty words. The themed modules covered most of them, and this topic sweeps up the rest, about four hundred. We won't read all four hundred. Today we pick the most useful ones, theme by theme."),
