            leo("«Wo» is where. Then what's «woher»?"),
            maya("The «wo» family has three members. «Wo» is where you are. «Woher» is where from, and «wohin» is where to. A favourite trap: «Woher kommst du» asks where you come from, not where you live."),
            jonas("Woher kommst du? Wohin fährst du? [repeat]", "Where do you come from? Where are you going?"),
            leo("And when, how and why?"),
            maya("«Wann», «wie» and «warum». They usually open the question, so the very first word tells you what kind of answer to give."),
            jonas("Wann beginnt der Kurs? Warum lernst du Deutsch? [repeat]", "When does the course start? Why are you learning German?"),
            leo("Okay, small words done. What's next?"),
            maya("Colours. The word for colour is «Farbe», and it's «die Farbe». To ask about a colour, you use «welche», which."),
