            jonas("Das Hemd ist weiß. Die Hose ist zu lang. [repeat]", "The shirt is white. The trousers are too long."),
            leo("And the things I lose every morning?"),
            maya("«der Schlüssel», the key, and «das Handy», the mobile. And glasses are «die Brille», just one thing in German, so Usaid wears «eine Brille»."),
