            leo("What about people? Forms always ask about people."),
            maya("Forms and family. A form asks for «der Familienstand», your marital status, and you tick «männlich» or «weiblich», male or female. For family, the list adds wife and husband: «die Ehefrau» and «der Ehemann». Here, Usaid introduces Sanya."),
            jonas("Das ist meine Ehefrau Sanya. [repeat]", "This is my wife Sanya."),
